{"product_id":"dateline-earth","title":"Dateline Earth","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe social web has transformed journalism and changed the way we find out what is happening around us. Information overload has shortened attention spans. It is getting harder to find stories with solutions to global crises. This is the third and updated edition of Dateline Earth: Journalism As If the Planet Mattered for journalists interested in covering issues like climate collapse, global inequities, governance. Kunda Dixit has devoted his career to covering development and environment in his native Nepal and internationally, and makes the case for a new journalism ethos.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Kunda Dixit \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9786169022725 \u003cbr\u003eFormat: \u003cbr\u003ePages 257\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44896133546137,"sku":"13RA9786169022725","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9e4c20c254e9b34cbb5a553c27b93e2b.jpg?v=1728897134","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/dateline-earth","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}